Hi <%= @appointment.patient.name.presence || @appointment.patient.email %>,

This is a reminder that you have an upcoming appointment tomorrow:

Clinic: <%= @clinic.name %>
Service: <%= @service.name %>
<% if @appointment.staff.present? -%>
With: <%= @appointment.staff.name.presence || @appointment.staff.email %>
<% end -%>
When: <%= @appointment.starts_at.strftime("%A, %B %-d, %Y at %-I:%M %p") %>
<% if @clinic.address.present? -%>
Address: <%= @clinic.address %>
<% end -%>

See you then! If you need to reschedule or cancel, please do so from your BookQ account.
